[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 23950.07, "timestamp": "06:39:10", "text": "說過，是的，不管發生什麼，我知道我是一個無法"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23955.51, "timestamp": "06:39:15", "text": "在銀行帳戶裡保持最低餘額的人，這現在很難，呃，現在大概是5000或4000盧比，而以前是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23961.99, "timestamp": "06:39:21", "text": "1000盧比。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23973.75, "timestamp": "06:39:33", "text": "是的。為了與規模較小的銀行（例如規模較小的銀行）保持一致，他們也"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23978.948, "timestamp": "06:39:38", "text": "至少有 2,000"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23981.75, "timestamp": "06:39:41", "text": "或 3,000 名員工。是的，沒問題。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23984.708, "timestamp": "06:39:44", "text": "心想，是啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23994.628, "timestamp": "06:39:54", "text": "我"}]